  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T14:08:12.726308Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T07:08:27.551156Z",
  "totalBlocks": 116,
  "translatedBlocks": 113,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b74c6925dfd2877",
      "translationZh": "当 Atos 着手提升 400 名工程师的技能，使他们在智能体 AI 领域从理论学习走向实际交付时，团队面临一个常见的挑战：如何培养解决现实问题的能力，而不只是掌握理论知识。在线课程和课堂教学能够打好基础，但并不总能让团队获得将 AI 有效应用于业务问题所需的信心或实践经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa0cd2015388f572",
      "translationZh": "通过 Atos 与 AWS 的合作，我们已经认识到，动手实践学习是有效赋能 AI 应用所缺失的关键要素。此前，我们曾在 2025 年通过 AWS DeepRacer 开展强化学习方面的实践技能培训，并通过 AI League 开展模型微调方面的实践技能培训。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1fb9ff4946466e5",
      "translationZh": "2026 年，Atos 与 AWS 合作，为 400 名工程师举办了一场智能体 AI League 活动。在三天时间里，工程师们从仅有有限的动手实践经验，进步到能够构建具备路径规划、安全护栏、记忆功能和经过微调的模型的多智能体系统。他们在一个同时根据性能和效率评分的实时排行榜上展开竞争。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4edf7e1fe82a1f59",
      "translationZh": "参与者的技能水平差异很大。有些是已有 AWS 使用经验的开发者。另一些则是首次使用 AWS，或担任技术性较弱的角色，例如产品负责人和项目经理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13410bb2e8111ede",
      "translationZh": "5% 此前对智能体 AI 一无所知。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5b1dcdc0b813e92",
      "translationZh": "25% 对这一主题有基本了解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "daca42ac78407813",
      "translationZh": "50% 理解这一主题，但没有动手实践经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9927a52dc1e87546",
      "translationZh": "20% 拥有使用智能体 AI 服务的实践经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ed7ffbcd9530fb3",
      "translationZh": "本文解释了我们为何选择 AI League 这一形式、工程师构建了什么并学到了什么、涉及哪些 AWS 服务，以及其他企业在举办类似活动时应考虑哪些事项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4419943c1a4937c",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择 AWS AI League？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6553aae29d8d9ccc",
      "translationZh": "Atos 在智能体 AI 领域作出了战略承诺，包括在全球多个地点建设 Sovereign Agentic AI Studios。我们需要一种方法，让工程团队快速提升运用智能体 AI 模式的能力，不是通过被动培训，而是通过亲手实践交付。传统研讨会教授概念，而 AI League 则通过实践工作培养能力，其条件更贴近真实交付场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1675f83dac60e8a7",
      "translationZh": "与常规培训相比，AI League 这一形式具有以下几项优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a58563224dd16b93",
      "translationZh": "即时实践应用——工程师构建了可运行的智能体系统，而不是仅仅阅读相关资料。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f16ea6067a27c266",
      "translationZh": "竞争激励——排行榜带来了被动学习很少能实现的紧迫感和参与度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8462ddf2a0cd53e9",
      "translationZh": "真实的 AWS 服务——活动期间构建的所有成果都使用了原生 AWS 服务，工程师可以将这些服务应用于客户项目交付，包括 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore、AWS Lambda、Kiro 和 Amazon SageMaker。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a217957decce67c",
      "translationZh": "可衡量的成果——AI League 排行榜分数反映了功能完整性和解决方案效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a76b00b38c67e3b",
      "translationZh": "时间投入与活动形式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ab23d69ac2a84ec",
      "translationZh": "AWS AI League 是一套开箱即用的解决方案，因此筹备工作很简单。筹备只需要与 AWS 通几次电话，商定后勤安排和活动细节，再建立一种宣传活动并收集参与者信息的机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3b292b428d4d8cd",
      "translationZh": "由于 AWS AI League 通过 AWS Workshop Studio 提供，活动可以安排在一到三天内进行。为了给工程师最大的灵活性，我们选择了为期三天的形式。参与者需要投入的时间如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c13efb5cf0d4fed",
      "translationZh": "初始启动工作坊（2 小时）——介绍 AI League、所使用的 AWS 服务以及挑战的形式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "701b49c0d930d72f",
      "translationZh": "每日答疑会议（1 小时）——为需要帮助或想分享想法的工程师提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73e2f588ec1f4cb2",
      "translationZh": "前三名决赛（1 小时）——在这一环节，我们为 2026 年冠军加冕。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30a86650b1e6cd9d",
      "translationZh": "在这些预定环节之外，工程师可以根据已有事务安排，自由迭代自己的智能体 AI 解决方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5148a52caf9f2a30",
      "translationZh": "AI League 挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96266af7306c089d",
      "translationZh": "工程师们构建了一个能够自主探索地牢迷宫的 AI 智能体。该智能体必须在地图中找到一条路径，解决各个地块上的挑战，避开陷阱，并抵达宝藏所在地。所有这些任务都必须在限定时间内、生命次数有限的条件下完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4129716e01e52600",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了一张 AWS AI League 地图的概览。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "870f54862dfd1120",
      "translationZh": "图 1：AWS AI League 地图概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6d4eeb9911f38ab",
      "translationZh": "评分模型对以下表现给予奖励：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fbfd1e95ee40195",
      "translationZh": "成功完成挑战——回答正确可获得分数，回答错误则会损失生命次数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17a4e51a70eb7c93",
      "translationZh": "收集金币——与挑战不同，收集金币没有风险，也不需要额外时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb33a20c390c2789",
      "translationZh": "完成地图——工程师在规定时间内抵达宝藏所在地即可获得宝藏奖励分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e7b7912ca64a365",
      "translationZh": "保留生命次数——挑战结束时，每次剩余生命都会带来额外分数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b655b37a6e1ce432",
      "translationZh": "效率——简洁的智能体回复比更冗长的回复得分更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8b87fc40c421f1c",
      "translationZh": "微调——开发专用小语言模型可获得额外加分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "def15b8879e40d2d",
      "translationZh": "这些挑战类型考查了不同的 AI 工程技能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e323fc2daeb359b0",
      "translationZh": "AI 安全与内容过滤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95e62d3ab938233d",
      "translationZh": "代码生成与执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f21cef146f0307a",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Code Interpreter，Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fde29dd4eaef7365",
      "translationZh": "跨交互的上下文保留",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff45ab32447dda2a",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore memory，Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b31cc12799635d9",
      "translationZh": "从网络来源检索信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebcbddc108facf35",
      "translationZh": "以高效的 token 使用获取通用知识",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "107b02ab11e2dfca",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock（提示词工程）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82cad507dcc52e6a",
      "translationZh": "结构化数据提取",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d73440f37b073748",
      "translationZh": "路径规划与风险评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a509c54b501554c5",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了解决方案架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78ce3926c71afa44",
      "translationZh": "图 2：AWS AI League 架构概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bacbd45c1eb198f1",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Bedrock，工程师访问了为智能体推理提供支持的模型。有关各区域的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的“按 AWS 区域支持的模型”：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d3ee70e0b107734",
      "translationZh": "为不同任务选择合适的模型，先使用一个广为人知的模型，然后使用他们自己微调的模型执行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff81f182cc363c1b",
      "translationZh": "设计有效的系统提示词，以高效回答问题，或将任务委派给子智能体和工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dab2919352fce848",
      "translationZh": "管理 token 用量和成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "857088656d3b7f51",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个可使用任意框架或模型大规模构建、连接和优化智能体的平台，工程师借助它编排多智能体系统。在 AI League 期间，工程师使用了以下 AgentCore 功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db5846b94def383e",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore runtime 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能——工程师用它托管智能体容器，这些容器处理挑战任务块，并在时限内返回供评分的响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b3adea5340515fc",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Gateway 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项能力——工程师通过 Model Context Protocol（MCP）将智能体的工具调用路由到 Lambda 函数，用于寻路、网页抓取和代码执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd1d26e6fca60552",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore memory 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项能力——工程师在多次交互之间持久化保存上下文，使智能体能够回忆先前的事件，例如已收集的钥匙和已解决的挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c08f86d52bdc02cd",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Code Interpreter 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项能力——工程师在隔离的沙箱中安全地执行代码，以应对计算类挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23e1f593de23c909",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails，你可以过滤内容，防范有害输入和输出。工程师配置了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be9130c5929239ce",
      "translationZh": "禁止主题——必须屏蔽的特定内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "377ed382062abaef",
      "translationZh": "内容过滤器——针对仇恨、暴力和不当行为的阈值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc7e5d3e9607d085",
      "translationZh": "输入和输出拦截，并配有自定义消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "055207748662621b",
      "translationZh": "借助 AWS Lambda，你可以为模型无法独立可靠处理的任务构建自定义工具函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ba114691ea277ca",
      "translationZh": "路径规划——使用广度优先搜索（BFS）等算法在地图上导航。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5975e96cc583b37b",
      "translationZh": "代码解释器——执行代码以应对计算挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aeeb264198dbfa36",
      "translationZh": "网页抓取——获取并解析网页，以检索信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c8ef74fff8edf25",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon SageMaker，您可以构建开发环境并微调模型。工程师使用了基于可验证奖励的强化学习（RLVR）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "147dc7289d236e70",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker Studio 提供了开发环境，其中包括内置 AI 开发工具的集成开发环境（IDE）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a57aea91f238238",
      "translationZh": "无服务器微调使用参与者创建的数据集来训练自定义模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3627228c511a357f",
      "translationZh": "随后，将微调后的模型部署到推理端点，以处理流量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c3a10327ba586a7",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了模型微调的工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46dd4599139d9542",
      "translationZh": "图 3：微调模型概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "21314bd828d6a6d0",
      "translationZh": "我们的工程师学到了什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7334658318f2f49d",
      "translationZh": "AWS AI League 揭示了几项实用的工程经验，可直接应用于生产环境中的智能体 AI 工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1c017560b612903b",
      "translationZh": "约束条件下的提示工程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ea98b2a225195e",
      "translationZh": "最明确的经验之一是，成功并不只是来自编写提示，而是来自编写能够在实际约束条件下奏效的提示。每多一个 token 都会扣分。每一次不必要的工具调用都会消耗时间并扣分。工程师们很快发现，让解决方案运行起来只是第一步。让它高效运行，才是这场比赛与真实客户场景最相关的部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ec39ce3064c8611",
      "translationZh": "多智能体架构决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e803e3cda0f97f8",
      "translationZh": "工程师必须决定在架构中纳入多少个智能体，从配备专用工具的单用途智能体，到功能更丰富的多用途智能体。每种方案都涉及 token 用量、延迟和可靠性之间的权衡。这与生产环境中关于智能体设计的实际决策高度一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d21d79b59da4181c",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了不同的智能体系统在决赛中如何应对挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23ccbc7f2b2b906e",
      "translationZh": "图 4：不同智能体系统应对挑战的概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c7967c4d475395b",
      "translationZh": "护栏配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01d6e7d604590f25",
      "translationZh": "Violent Violet 挑战揭示了一个重要教训：护栏必须足够精准，既能阻止不良内容，又不会过度拦截合法查询。如果护栏过于严格，工程师就无法通过其他挑战。如果护栏过于宽松，他们就无法通过护栏挑战。这直接对应了生产环境中 AI 安全的一条实践经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0117bfc10a201317",
      "translationZh": "寻路算法设计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b499c11557370706",
      "translationZh": "构建寻路工具需要工程师考虑以下问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38d1b9f9d1da617b",
      "translationZh": "针对不同场景采用多种策略（速度与得分最大化之间的权衡）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbb20d153d540b4b",
      "translationZh": "风险评估（尖刺会消耗生命，而墙壁会结束游戏）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22da49896a379e07",
      "translationZh": "时间预算（我们应该访问每个挑战，还是直奔宝藏？）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3af2324df3705b7",
      "translationZh": "依赖顺序（例如，先收集钥匙，再尝试开门）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46a36913d3bc92f4",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了在同一张地图上使用多种寻路策略的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7e46c86650dd353",
      "translationZh": "图 5：多种不同寻路策略的示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d400f9a59b1ab13",
      "translationZh": "可观测性的价值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c72670f1d9e52877",
      "translationZh": "在两次运行之间检查 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 的工程师似乎进步得更快。那些靠猜测判断哪里出了问题的工程师往往进展较慢。这进一步印证了一条核心工程原则：为解决方案妥善配置监测手段，并在行动前先进行观察。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cc195311d1f88e4",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了如何使用 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 排查 Lambda 函数的故障。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5708aea71f8d019c",
      "translationZh": "图 6：使用 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 排查 Lambda 函数的故障",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab768199a33b4ffe",
      "translationZh": "使用 AI 构建智能体式 AI 解决方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b88569d79351c2e6",
      "translationZh": "使用 Kiro 等 AI 开发工具的工程师通常进展迅速。向 AI 工具提供挑战完整上下文的工程师，往往能更快地取得更好的结果。这进一步印证了一条更普遍的经验：当 AI 工具立足于正在解决的具体问题时，就能创造更大的价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4da114438eb97291",
      "translationZh": "根据活动报名数据，400 名工程师获得了智能体式 AI 的实践经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ad3d008f388a414",
      "translationZh": "工程师们掌握了 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon Bedrock AgentCore、AWS Lambda、Amazon Bedrock Guardrails、Kiro 和 Amazon SageMaker 的实用技能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "761500e6bd93f244",
      "translationZh": "内部涌现出一批推动者，他们在客户项目中应用智能体式 AI 时更加自信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4bac6b0f4b0f586",
      "translationZh": "竞赛形式鼓励了知识共享，并帮助打破了团队之间的壁垒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edc6e7de63a072aa",
      "translationZh": "表现最出色的解决方案体现了周密的工程设计。其中包括自定义寻路策略、精心调优的护栏、具备记忆感知能力的智能体，以及旨在减少 token 用量的微调模型。祝贺排名前三的参赛者：James Ponter、Adam Różewicki 和 Eduard-Cosmin Socol。冠军 James Ponter 担任超大规模云服务商业务负责人——UKI 云与基础设施，他这样总结此次活动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e38632a7f6023e3",
      "translationZh": "“理论学习为你打下基础，而 AWS AI League 则以一种真正改变你思维方式的形式，让这些基础知识接受压力考验。在真实的 AWS 基础设施上构建贴近生产环境的多智能体架构，不是做一个玩具项目，而是构建一个同时按性能和效率评分的系统，这会迫使你将概念内化，而不只是理解它们。倒计时进行时，你没法去查答案。这种时间压力，加上你的决策会对排行榜产生实际影响这一事实，带来了很难在其他学习环境中复制的深度投入。它以一种令人牢牢记住的方式，弥合了知与行之间的鸿沟。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3d8f4ed6236e32c",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了决赛排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c5f91b962bd2caa",
      "translationZh": "图 7：我们的决赛排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6d2367d1facda98",
      "translationZh": "Atos 的 AWS 联盟全球负责人 Chris Byrne 就采用游戏化学习方式提升 AWS 技能的益处，发表了以下总结评论：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5802f7300b3f27",
      "translationZh": "“从理论知识迈向实践经验，一方面可能令人望而生畏，另一方面，要知道从哪里开始、如何开始也颇具挑战。Atos 已成功利用 AWS 联赛，通过 AWS DeepRacer 开展强化学习、通过 AI League 进行模型微调，以及在今年的联赛中探索智能体 AI，为我们的团队提供了一个平台，让他们能够在充满吸引力和乐趣的环境中积累经验、提升技能，而无需承受真实项目中的表现压力。公司各部门的参与程度，以及 Atos 参赛者在公开联赛中取得的成绩，都说明了这种学习方式的有效性。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9a1e143a87a60ad",
      "translationZh": "AWS AI League 在整个 2026 年均可用于企业活动，也会在部分 AWS Summits 和线上活动中举办。其形式灵活多样，从半天的工作坊到持续多天的黑客马拉松均可，AWS 会提供基础设施、账户和活动组织支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7f8aca1e34682b6",
      "translationZh": "若想探索为您的组织举办 AI League 活动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6063ea977c7462d0",
      "translationZh": "访问 AWS AI League 页面，了解该计划。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4cb84af7ec817258",
      "translationZh": "联系您的 AWS 客户团队，讨论举办专属活动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b72ddcd32358c4c",
      "translationZh": "加入 AWS AI League Builder Space，获取官方公告，并加入 AI Community 空间，与社区分享想法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7f11c061eaa7258",
      "translationZh": "AWS AI League 不仅仅是一项竞赛。它还是加速培养 AI 实践技能、鼓励创意分享的有效方式。要了解更多信息，或探索为您的组织举办活动，请访问 AWS AI League 页面或联系您的 AWS 客户团队。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1490ab4055ce02a8",
      "translationZh": "阅读《AWS AI League：模型定制与智能体对决》，进一步了解 AWS AI League 的智能体 AI 和模型定制挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c4399a8886ff1e3",
      "translationZh": "阅读《从初学者到冠军：一名学生的 AWS AI League 东盟总决赛之旅》，了解一名学生如何从初学者成长为冠军。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "091c9f1e77d71565",
      "translationZh": "有关将智能体 AI 从竞赛推向生产环境的指导，请参阅《企业中的 AI 智能体：Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 最佳实践》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
